Project Zomboid Mods Repository

This branch holds my Project Zomboid mod projects, one folder per mod.

Projects:
- Quick-Restart/: Quick Restart
- Tile-Doctor/: Tile Doctor
- Competitive Play Framework (still on its own branches, see below)

Each mod folder holds a Dev tree and a Prod tree. Both carry the same code;
only the mod id, the mod name, the build constants and workshop.txt differ.

Branch layout:
- PZ-Hub: main branch, one folder per mod
- CompetitivePlayFramework: Competitive Play Framework stable branch
- CPF-Dev: Competitive Play Framework development branch
